-- passkey in review is refused (spec 7.7), so it is the action the passkey message names. A thief who replaced the
-- recovery codes holds the new set, which stays valid as a second factor after a password change, so the recovery
-- message tells the owner to make new codes too. The Persian bodies stay inside the 64 UCS-2 units of one billed
-- part (D58, internal/sms TestOTPBodiesFitOnePart), the English ones inside 160 GSM-7 units.
